      "text": "agent_a: observations from train_split.csv \u2014 712 rows, Survived skewed (439 deaths/273 survivors). Test set is females only (61 rows). Female survival is heavily driven by Pclass: \u22480.97 (class 1), \u22480.91 (class 2), \u22480.50 (class 3). Remember Prediction uses 1=death, 0=survival (inverse of Survived). Good luck!"
    },
